  "body": "* Legal Home & Income\r\n* Six bedrooms, four bathrooms and double garage\r\n* Approx. 365sqm floor area on a 483sqm site\r\n* Multiple living areas and additional kitchen facilities\r\n* Two-level home with a flexible layout\r\n* Established tenant in place\r\n* Current tenant intends to remain, providing continuity of rental income\r\n* Close to Long Bay Beach, Long Bay Village and local amenities\r\n* Zoned for Long Bay School, Northcross Intermediate and Long Bay College\r\n* Viewing By Appointment\r\n\r\nPositioned in Long Bay, this substantial two-level home offers approximately 365sqm of floor area on a 483sqm site, with a Legal Home & Income configuration.\r\n\r\nOffering six bedrooms, four bathrooms, double garaging and multiple living areas, the property provides a flexible layout together with additional kitchen facilities.\r\n\r\nCurrently tenanted, with the existing tenant intending to remain.\r\n\r\nConveniently located close to Long Bay Beach, Long Bay Village, local amenities and a selection of schools, this is a substantial investment property offering space, flexibility and an established rental setup.\r\n\r\nContact Team Vinson & Amy on 022 571 7074 to arrange your private viewing or visit one of our upcoming open homes. Learn more at www.vinsonamyandco.nz.",
